PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783673336
OL,3,CWild card contender Arthur Fery
OL,4,Creaches Wimbledon quarter-finals
OL,6,FHaving trailed Zizou Bergs 4-1 in both
OL,7,Fthe fourth and fifth sets on Saturday,
OL,8,FFery was twice a break down in the
OL,9,Ffourth here but roused himself
OL,10,Fmagnificently to set up a clash with
OL,11,Fninth seed Flavio Cobolli, who he beat
OL,12,Fat the Australian Open.
OL,14,FAfter all the doom and gloom
OL,15,Fsurrounding British tennis to start
OL,16,Fthe fortnight, Fery's run has been
OL,17,Fquite the plot twist, and the Centre
OL,18,FCourt crowd roared on their new hero.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
