PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783673336
OL,3,CWild card contender Arthur Fery
OL,4,Creaches Wimbledon quarter-finals
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FHis victory makes him the first
OL,12,FBritish wild card to reach the quarter-
OL,13,Ffinals at a grand slam in the open
OL,14,Fera, while he joins Andy Murray, Tim
OL,15,FHenman, Cameron Norrie, Roger Taylor
OL,16,Fand Greg Rusedski as home male members
OL,17,Fof the Wimbledon last-eight club.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
