PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783673336
OL,3,CWild card contender Arthur Fery
OL,4,Creaches Wimbledon quarter-finals
OL,6,FWhen Dimitrov's final backhand hit the
OL,7,Fnet after three hours and 55 minutes,
OL,8,FFery looked to his family and team in
OL,9,Fthe stands in disbelief.
OL,11,F"I've no words right now," he said.
OL,12,F"It's incredibly tough to put words to
OL,13,Fwhat I've just felt on a tennis court
OL,14,Fin front of all you guys. The support
OL,15,Fwas phenomenal.
OL,17,F"First time on this court, five sets
OL,18,Fagainst an absolute legend of the
OL,19,Fgame. I grew up five minutes from
OL,20,Fhere, I grew up coming to watch
OL,21,Fmatches on this court."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
