CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783673336
OL,3,CWild card contender Arthur Fery
OL,4,Creaches Wimbledon quarter-finals
OL,6,FTurning to Roger Federer, Fery added:
OL,7,F"We've got probably the greatest of
OL,8,Fall time watching from the front row
OL,9,Fof the Royal Box. Now playing here in
OL,10,Ffront of all you guys and winning,
OL,11,Fit's unbelievable."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
